WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.771
Hilbert's sixteenth problem.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.163
How many loops can a polynomial flow have?

3
00:00:05.163 --> 00:00:07.526
Lean checks the quintic case: two at most.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.551
Split each loop into local passages, bound

5
00:00:11.551 --> 00:00:13.738
each piece, then glue by compactness.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.315
Claimed: a bound for every degree.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.015
Lean covers part.
